{
  "id": "launch/repo/nested-launch-from-the-target-writes-home",
  "title": "a jitso launch from inside the target, with JITSO_PROJECT set, uses the caller's builds and registry and opens in the home repository unless --repo says otherwise",
  "tags": [
    "posix"
  ],
  "source": [
    "intended: docs/decisions.md, Only launches are blocked, and launches into other repositories"
  ],
  "intent": "The worker's cwd is the target but its fleet is the caller's. Without --repo the target is the home repository, so the terminal opens at path:<home> and the launch is an ordinary one; with --repo it goes back into the target.",
  "project": {
    "files": {
      ".jitso/briefs/brief.md": "## Goal\n\nFind where the sync entry point of this project is defined and explain in a few sentences how it is wired to the rest of the code.\n\n## Scope\n\nRead only. Look at `src/sync.ts` and `docs/guide.md` and nothing outside the repo. Do not change any file.\n\n## Done when\n\nYou can name the file and the line that defines the entry point, and you have checked it by reading the file.\n\n## Report format\n\nOne short paragraph with the file path, the line number and a one line summary of what it does.\n"
    }
  },
  "home": {
    "files": {
      "target/readme.txt": "target\n"
    }
  },
  "orca": {
    "responses": {
      "repo list": {
        "repos": [
          {
            "id": "r0",
            "path": "{{HOME}}/target"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "git_init": {
        "path": "{{HOME}}/target"
      }
    },
    {
      "run": [
        "launch",
        "--build",
        "haiku-explorer",
        "--brief",
        "{{PROJECT}}/.jitso/briefs/brief.md",
        "--mode",
        "direct"
      ],
      "cwd": "{{HOME}}/target",
      "env": {
        "JITSO_PROJECT": "{{PROJECT}}"
      },
      "capture": {
        "LAUNCH_ID": {
          "from": "stdout",
          "regex": "JITSO (L\\d{8}T\\d{6}-[0-9a-f]{4})",
          "group": 1
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "exit": 0,
        "orca_calls": {
          "verbs": [
            "terminal create",
            "terminal wait",
            "terminal read"
          ],
          "calls": [
            {
              "at": 0,
              "argv": [
                "terminal",
                "create",
                "--worktree",
                "path:{{PROJECT}}",
                "--title",
                "[jitso:{{LAUNCH_ID}}] haiku-explorer",
                "--command",
                "'{{PROJECT}}/.jitso/launches/{{LAUNCH_ID}}/run.sh'"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "registry": {
          "count": 1,
          "events": [
            {
              "at": 0,
              "event": "launch",
              "fields": {
                "repo": "project",
                "repo_path": {
                  "absent": true
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "files": [
          {
            "path": "{{HOME}}/target/.jitso",
            "exists": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "run": [
        "launch",
        "--build",
        "haiku-explorer",
        "--brief",
        "{{PROJECT}}/.jitso/briefs/brief.md",
        "--mode",
        "direct",
        "--repo",
        "{{HOME}}/target",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "cwd": "{{HOME}}/target",
      "env": {
        "JITSO_PROJECT": "{{PROJECT}}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "exit": 0,
        "stdout": [
          "target {{HOME}}/target | home {{PROJECT}}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
